    "summary": "The bearer must be on the table when the opposing [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) ends. That is your window to use this once per battle. You may spend up to four [Yield Points](vsdata:ability/leagues-of-votann.prioritised-efficiency). Choose one friendly HERNKYN unit and up to one more per two points spent. When checking [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) for each choice, ignore enemies marked Assailed by [Assailed From Every Angle](vsdata:ability/leagues-of-votann.persecution-prospect.assailed-from-every-angle). You may move the chosen units off the table into [Strategic Reserves](vsdata:core-rule/strategic-reserves).",
